        "TextContent": {
          "Namespace": "Lawine_128_Lv_5",
          "Key": "Row2_TextContent_FromRoleId128",
          "SourceString": "是关于红茶好喝还是绿茶好喝的主题。",
          "LocalizedString": "They're arguing about which is better - black tea or green tea."
