        "ContentType": "ECyCommunicationContentType::Text",
        "TextContent": {
          "Namespace": "Lawine_128_Lv_5",
          "Key": "Row3_TextContent_FromRoleId128",
          "SourceString": "原本是想组织大家好好品茶，结果大家各自分成了两个派别。",
          "LocalizedString": "I originally wanted to just hold a tea tasting, but in the end, it seems like everyone's taken a side."
